    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d755">

                <pb facs="0848" n="838" xml:id="pg838"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">800.0146/164: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Atcheson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chungking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-09-16T10:00:00+07:00">September 16,
                            1943—10 a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 12:58 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1730. Embassy’s 1688, September 12. We have now received an informal note from
                    Acting Foreign Minister dated September 15 in which Dr. Wu states that the
                    issuance of statement in question is both timely and proper in the opinion of
                    Chinese Government. He adds that, however “in view of prospective developments
                    in military situation in Far East”, it is feeling of Chinese Government that
                    there is a similar need of common understanding in regard to question of
                    administration of liberated areas in this region. He expresses the hope of
                    Chinese Government that such common understanding may be reached at an early
                    date by Governments of the United States, Great Britain and China and he asks
                    that his comments and this hope be brought to the attention of the American
                    Government.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Atcheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
